{#- The narrator's (director's) render of a structured turn (FR-TURN-1,4; #150).

Rendered before the character's when the turn needs narration (a scene change, a player input
that addresses no character, an open salient reference). The ``system`` block holds the rating
guidance (always first, FR-RATE-4), the custom instructions, the scenario text, the director's
notes labelled apart from the facts (#122, FR-SCN-11: the narrator's context alone), the scene
and who is present, the working memory as the narrator perceives it (omniscient, ``think``
excluded), the retrieved context and the canon, then the narration contract and, on a
guardrail regeneration, the constraint lines (#68). The ``user`` block is the player input. -#}
{% macro line(entry) -%}
{% if entry.text %}{{ entry.text }}{% else %}{{ entry.name }}:{% if entry.say %} "{{ entry.say }}"{% endif %}{% if entry.do %} *{{ entry.do }}*{% endif %}{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
